title: Bump collation `in_peers` to 300 for the experimental collator protocol
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: Sync the values of `CONNECTED_PEERS_PARA_LIMIT` in experimental collator
    protocol and `MAX_AUTHORITY_INCOMING_STREAMS` in peer_set.
crates:
- name: cumulus-relay-chain-minimal-node
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-collator-protocol
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-node-network-protocol
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: patch
